{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt: Showdown 1896 is a new era of the addictively unforgiving extraction shooter. In corrupted backwaters lost to history, fight back alone \u2013 or with friends \u2013 against timeless evil. Twisted monsters and other ruthless Hunters stand between you and your Bounty. Risk everything as Hunt consumes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/c07dbfc01e416f94cb937fe15b349ffc.poster.avif?t=1775149392\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/c07dbfc01e416f94cb937fe15b349ffc.webm?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/c07dbfc01e416f94cb937fe15b349ffc.mp4?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take rich bounties and kill anyone that tries to stop you \u2013 and they will try. Race competing Hunters to track down bosses, send them to hell, claim their bounty, and fight your way to extract. If others only slow you down, go alone. If you find strength in numbers, take up to two teammates along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/22f8e8d0e927b2f8827cd1378af2e4fe.poster.avif?t=1775149392\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/22f8e8d0e927b2f8827cd1378af2e4fe.webm?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/22f8e8d0e927b2f8827cd1378af2e4fe.mp4?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk everything to unlock dark powers and forbidden wealth. Every bullet counts. Every wound hurts. And every death is permanent. But if you succeed, every victory will be unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/a27d29be662349b033d77bfdaaa1837b.poster.avif?t=1775149392\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/a27d29be662349b033d77bfdaaa1837b.webm?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/a27d29be662349b033d77bfdaaa1837b.mp4?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear footsteps squelch in the mud as you wait with bated breath to strike. The world speaks. Every gunshot is a message; every howling dog a klaxon. Gramophones murmur with the haunting melodies of Port Sulphur Band. Listen, and you might live to die another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/43cafa1a9392d0ec4e14d7093cf34019.poster.avif?t=1775149392\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/43cafa1a9392d0ec4e14d7093cf34019.webm?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/43cafa1a9392d0ec4e14d7093cf34019.mp4?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep striving for more, the world is always growing. Frequent updates challenge you with new Events, expand your arsenal of weapons, introduce new characters, and offer the chance to get ornate rewards. Join the thriving Hunt community, stay informed, and get an edge over the Corruption.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"cedd1ad1f320f7e8e6c250339514480f6e6a4d09.jpg","localized_name":"Initiation Complete","name":"Initiation Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/594650/cedd1ad1f320f7e8e6c250339514480f6e6a4d09.jpg"},{"icon":"db599add9ba9608abf8c458ff18db1d8292784ee.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome to Tier 2","name":"Welcome to Tier 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/594650/db599add9ba9608abf8c458ff18db1d8292784ee.jpg"},{"icon":"ce3971ebe45540e021a750ce7183ab9c6b31ae7c.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome to Tier 3","name":"Welcome to Tier 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/594650/ce3971ebe45540e021a750ce7183ab9c6b31ae7c.jpg"},{"icon":"037ed94b3f0b463f606ddc1ff421098a424a420f.jpg","localized_name":"Bloodline Peak","name":"Bloodline Peak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/594650/037ed94b3f0b463f606ddc1ff421098a424a420f.jpg"},{"icon":"0aaa208de0abf208f1b0dc9781ba46b9f5e5735c.jpg","localized_name":"Convalescent Home","name":"Convalescent Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/594650/0aaa208de0abf208f1b0dc9781ba46b9f5e5735c.jpg"},{"icon":"5d2df83dd8276a2c7911beb4acbec1b4b75c0fd7.jpg","localized_name":"Fifty Shades of Survival","name":"Fifty Shades of Survival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/594650/5d2df83dd8276a2c7911beb4acbec1b4b75c0fd7.jpg"},{"icon":"0aac348ea3fcae4ca353ca5dc19cc280116e4fef.jpg","localized_name":"Five-Ace Hand","name":"Five-Ace Hand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st