as/22f8e8d0e927b2f8827cd1378af2e4fe.poster.avif?t=1775149392\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/22f8e8d0e927b2f8827cd1378af2e4fe.webm?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/22f8e8d0e927b2f8827cd1378af2e4fe.mp4?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk everything to unlock dark powers and forbidden wealth. Every bullet counts. Every wound hurts. And every death is permanent. But if you succeed, every victory will be unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/a27d29be662349b033d77bfdaaa1837b.poster.avif?t=1775149392\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/a27d29be662349b033d77bfdaaa1837b.webm?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/a27d29be662349b033d77bfdaaa1837b.mp4?t=1775149392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear footsteps squelch in the mud as you wait with bated breath to strike. The world speaks. Every gunshot is a message; every howling dog a klaxon. Gramophones murmur with the haunting melodies of Port Sulphur Band. Listen, and you might live to die another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/594650/extras/43cafa1a9392d0ec4e14d7093cf34019.poster.avif?t=1775149392\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"htt